mage caption: a photo of a group of people standing in front of a car]\n[S4T17] (dia_id: D4:17)\n\nCalvin: Wow, your shop looks great! I'd love to check it out sometime. What sort of cars do you work on at your shop?\n[S4T18] (dia_id: D4:18)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! I work on all kinds of cars at the shop - from regular maintenance to full restorations of classic cars. It keeps me busy and happy!\n[S4T19] (dia_id: D4:19)\n\nCalvin: Wow Dave, working on cars must be really rewarding.\n[S4T20] (dia_id: D4:20)\n\nDave: Definitely, working on cars is what I'm passionate about. Doing it every day is so rewarding! Seeing the transformation is awesome and knowing I'm helping people keep their cars in good condition is really satisfying.\n[S4T21] (dia_id: D4:21)\n\nCalvin: Wow Dave, that's awesome! Doing something you love and helping others is so rewarding. Keep up the great work!\n[S4T22] (dia_id: D4:22)\n\nDave: Thanks, Cal! I really appreciate the boost. It means a lot that my work is valued and that it brings joy to others.\n[S4T23] (dia_id: D4:23)\n\nCalvin: Glad to help, Dave! So awesome to see you doing your thing and making a difference. Your hard work and talent totally deserve all the recognition. Keep on keepin' on, bud! Take a look at this beautiful necklace with a diamond pendant, that's so stunning!\n[Image caption: a photo of a gold necklace with a diamond pendant]\n[S4T24] (dia_id: D4:24)","text_sha256":"8a90301effbdec32685d581c2b13becf683ae3be15d540eec6681f20c2a8704c","timestamp":"2023-05-01T18:24:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D4:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":14,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S4T1]"],"text_sha256":"67c520daf4207aed5d689fa6fb544f71bbe85b2d45663401ad4399db56cff716"},{"dia_ids":["D4:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":18,"line_start":16,"source_locators":["[S4T2]"],"text_sha256":"c78141eba36cca6542e1f7d6b7d3914c30edd4cf21d182379bb2e55