ession_date":"2023-05-01","session_datetime":"2023-05-01T18:24:00","session_id":"session_4","session_index":4,"source_sha256":"91f17581ccd8dcef52d1821ace4a2d5265d3c3ac8be04b9d12875f6ca76e5823","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":12}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Hey Calvin, long time no see! A lot's been happening since we last talked. Guess what? I finally opened my own car maintenance shop! It's so satisfying to have a spot to work on cars - it's like a dream come true! Take a look at the photo.\n[Image caption: a photo of a car dealership with cars parked in front of it]\n[S4T1] (dia_id: D4:1)\n\nCalvin: Wow Dave! Congrats on opening your own car maintenance shop! It looks like all your hard work and dedication paid off.\n[Image caption: a photo of a man standing under a car in a garage]\n[S4T2] (dia_id: D4:2)\n\nDave: Thanks, Cal! It's great to see my hard work paying off. Opening this shop was my dream, and I'm really happy to see it getting started. It was a lot of hard work, but it was worth it.\n[S4T3] (dia_id: D4:3)\n\nCalvin: Woo, Dave! Congrats on achieving your dream - you've got guts and ambition - that's awesome! Keep it up!\n[Image caption: a photo of a book with a space theme on it]\n[S4T4] (dia_id: D4:4)\n\nDave: Thanks! Appreciate the support. My dream was to open a shop and it's a step towards my other dream of working on classic cars. I love their design and engineering.\n[S4T5] (dia_id: D4:5)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! Going for it with classic cars is cool! Fulfilling your dreams is so important.\n[Image caption: a photo of a red car parked in a parking lot]\n[S4T6] (dia_id: D4:6)\n\nDave: I'm obsessed with classic cars. They have a unique charm. I was so thrilled to restore one last year—nothing like bringing it back to life! Take a look at the engine of the restored car.\n[Image caption: a photo of a car engine with a small air filter]\n[S4T7] (dia_id: D4:7)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! That looks awesome!\n[S4T8] (dia_id: D4:8)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! It was a labor of love. Challenging, but so worth it.\n[S4T9] (dia_id: D4:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, it's awesome when you see something you worked on come to life.\n[S4T10] (dia_id: D4:10)\n\nDave: Yeah! It feels great to see the hard work pay off, it's like bringing something back to life.\n[S4T11] (dia_id: D4:11)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, it's an amazing feeling when you create something and it resonates with people. It's so satisfying when you finish something you made from scratch!\n[S4T12] (dia_id: D4:12)","text_sha256":"17c71a64a489c65833dc9020850620f2a7d884cd610605ca16f6d5b79053cb15","timestamp":"2023-05-01T18:24:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D25:11"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":43,"line_start":42,"source_locators":["[S25T11]"],"text_sha256":"6d9ad59cab36f1cfb104447f015ca7eb5c6788ffa1680d08dcf91538b7c8b962"},{"dia_ids":["D25:12"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":46,"line_start":45,"source_locators":["[S25T12]"],"text_sha256":"9d4f596a3aa0c3596789761d12a3ab486e26be826f964625b1305948bfa965b5"},{"dia_ids":["D25:13"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":50,"line_start":48,"source_locators":["[S25T13]"],"text_sha256":"51aec8cb4ebf6b2cd584c105b4d951cc486e44d9359d961f0304f3ced8d39fb5"},{"dia_ids":["D25:14"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":53,"line_start":52,"source_locators":["[S25T14]"],"text_sha256":"09918af025bab819618c1bb765d95c969ea5507ae6c2c3f44dce103a339c675b"},{"dia_ids":["D25:15"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":57,"line_start":55,"source_locators":["[S25T15]"],"text_sha256":"3bea5c17242482d773fc898ab4d4b1d62bd455465dbbb344bcfbcdf5d35749ec"},{"dia_ids":["D25:16"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":60,"line_start":59,"source_locators":["[S25T16]"],"text_sha256":"05af21bd41c26b6c241ad84c0133a297fe27b3ff6ec6083793be94ab103e8cdd"},{"dia_ids":["D25:17"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":64,"line_start